{"title":"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a collection of red, blue, and green marbles, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more red marbles than blue marbles, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7edd3842c40dbc1e54e522917a6e07b43c92e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more green marbles than red marbles. Suppose that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> red marbles. What is the total number of marbles in the collection?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba987aeced743390dba9679e97efe23bbce263f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2.85r\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 3r\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 3.4r\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 3.85r\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 4.25r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"469\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of blue marbles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a6fda2ab126ed2ab5603cf6eb8812f5696aaed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" />, the number of green marbles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/1541cf18eb4764bec8e50c4515968d1b383717c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{5}r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" />, and the number of red marbles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the total number of marbles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027dca14b2871dd052c50b64a148db9e0b9b9368.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}r+\\frac{8}{5}r+r=3.4r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"152\" height=\"37\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the number of red marbles be 100. You have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96ba6d82c22a3599c6ed8db287bcbb8171c8fab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 80,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19da3d1cc9c70f4a5e84b54f94b592f20e18059b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = 160.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8eed414cb543ed3d52d12a35b26a3b45a7d75c9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100+80+160}{100} = \\boxed{3.4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"182\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A\">2008 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\